---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../utils/withBase';
---

<BaseLayout title="Sponsorship" description="Sponsor Metford Cobras FC and back local sport.">
	<section class="container-page py-10 md:py-14">
		<p class="kicker">Sponsorship</p>
		<h1 class="page-title">Back local sport. Get real local visibility.</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-700">
			Sponsoring the Cobras supports players and families &#8212; and connects your business with our community across Hunter, Newcastle and Lake Macquarie. Over the year we host thousands of players, parents, and supporters at our winter competition, summer 6&#8217;s competition, and end of year Gala Day.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-4">
			<div class="rounded-xl bg-cobra-blue/5 p-4 text-center">
				<div class="text-2xl font-medium text-cobra-blue">100</div>
				<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">Registered players</div>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl bg-cobra-blue/5 p-4 text-center">
				<div class="text-2xl font-medium text-cobra-blue">8</div>
				<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">Teams</div>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl bg-cobra-blue/5 p-4 text-center">
				<div class="text-2xl font-medium text-cobra-blue">30+</div>
				<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">Years in the community</div>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl bg-cobra-blue/5 p-4 text-center">
				<div class="text-2xl font-medium text-cobra-blue">15k</div>
				<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">Monthly Facebook views</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
			<a class="btn-primary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Enquire about sponsorship</a>
			<a class="btn-secondary" href="#tiers">View sponsorship tiers</a>
			<a class="btn-secondary" href={withBase('/assets/General 2026 Sponsorship Letter.pdf')} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" download>Download prospectus (PDF)</a>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Current sponsors</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-700">
				We&#8217;re grateful for the local businesses who back the Cobras. Please support the people who support community
				football.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="card">
					<a href="https://www.ftbbq.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="block">
						<img
							src={withBase('/assets/sponsors/oCWac0FPmXKJOLivc5O5jeJMmNwy57mL.png')}
							alt="F.T. BBQ logo placeholder"
							class="h-28 w-auto"
							loading="lazy"
							decoding="async"
						/>
						<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">F.T. BBQ</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
							The best products and advice for all things BBQ from an award winning team.
						</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
							Thanks for your continued support of Metford Cobras FC &#8212; it helps keep football affordable and our match
							days running.
						</p>
						<span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-cobra-blue">Visit website &#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>

				<div class="card">
					<a href="https://www.swirlndip.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="block">
						<img
							src={withBase('/assets/sponsors/swirl.png')}
							alt="Swirl n Dip logo placeholder"
							class="h-28 w-auto"
							loading="lazy"
							decoding="async"
						/>
						<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">Swirl n Dip</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
							An intergalactic taste sensation &#8212; perfect for celebrating wins (and shaking off tough losses).
						</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
							We appreciate your continued support of the club and the community we&#8217;re building.
						</p>
						<span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-cobra-blue">Visit website &#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>

				<div class="card">
					<a href="https://thewindsorcastle.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="block">
						<img
							src={withBase('/assets/sponsors/windsor-logo.png')}
							alt="The Windsor Castle logo placeholder"
							class="h-28 w-auto"
							loading="lazy"
							decoding="async"
						/>
						<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">The Windsor Castle</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
							A classic local venue for meals, catch-ups, and community get-togethers.
						</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
							Thank you for your continued support &#8212; your backing makes a real difference for players and families.
						</p>
						<span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-cobra-blue">Visit website &#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
			<div class="card">
				<h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">Community impact</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Help keep football accessible and build a strong local club.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">Brand exposure</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Reach families and locals through game days, signage and socials.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">Easy to support</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Simple tiers and clear deliverables. We&#8217;ll look after you.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="tiers" class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Sponsorship tiers</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Options for businesses of every size and budget.</p>

			<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
				<div class="card">
					<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
						<h3 class="text-base font-medium text-slate-900">Digital Sponsorship</h3>
						<span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cobra-blue/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-cobra-blue">$300</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>Your logo on our social media posts and email newsletters</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>3 sponsor showcase posts on our Facebook page</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>Facebook averages approx. 15,000 views per month during the playing season</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="card">
					<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
						<h3 class="text-base font-medium text-slate-900">Field Sponsorship</h3>
						<span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cobra-blue/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-cobra-blue">$600</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>All Digital Sponsorship benefits</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>Your banner or A-Frame displayed at all home games, finals, gala days, and summer 6&#8217;s events</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2 text-slate-500 text-xs"><span>Banner/A-Frame to be provided by your business.</span></li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="card">
					<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
						<h3 class="text-base font-medium text-slate-900">Team Sponsorship</h3>
						<span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cobra-blue/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-cobra-blue">$1,000</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>All Digital and Field Sponsorship benefits</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>Your logo on the chest of your nominated team&#8217;s jersey</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>A framed team photo and thank you letter to display at your business</li>
					</ul>
					<img
						src={withBase('/assets/sponsors/juniors-your-business-here.png')}
						alt="Junior jersey with sponsor logo placement example"
						class="mt-4 w-full rounded-xl object-cover"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
				</div>

				<div class="card bg-cobra-blue text-white ring-0">
					<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
						<h3 class="text-base font-medium text-white">Club Sponsorship</h3>
						<span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cobra-yellow/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-cobra-yellow">$5,000</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-white/80">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>All Digital and Field Sponsorship benefits</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>Your logo on the back of all team jerseys &#8212; junior and senior</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>A thank you video posted on our socials</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>A senior team jersey with your logo on the back</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cobra-yellow font-bold">&#8212;</span>A thank you letter to display at your business</li>
					</ul>
					<img
						src={withBase('/assets/sponsors/senior-women-your-business-here.png')}
						alt="Senior women&#8217;s jersey with sponsor logo placement example"
						class="mt-4 w-full rounded-xl object-cover"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-cobra-blue/5 p-5">
				<h3 class="text-base font-medium text-slate-900">Ready to get involved?</h3>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-700">Get in touch and we&#8217;ll work with you to find the right fit. We&#8217;re always happy to discuss arrangements that work for both parties.</p>
				<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
					<a class="btn-primary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Contact Us</a>
					<a class="btn-secondary" href="mailto:metfordcobrasfootballclub@gmail.com">metfordcobrasfootballclub@gmail.com</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
